keys    e
wait    2
keys    f
wait    2
keys    d
wait    2
keys    e
wait    2
keys    c
wait    3
snap
keys    q
wait    2

shot    accordian
size    24 80
cap     The whole deck dealt with `D', fifty-two cards laid out in four
