keys    q
wait    2

shot    bs
size    24 80
cap     Battleships against the computer, the fleet scattered with `R': your
cap     ships on the Main Board at the left, and the Hit/Miss Board at the
cap     right where you fire at the computer's.  Move the cursor with the
cap     h/j/k/l keys or the number pad and strike any other key to fire.
