run     bs
wait    5
keys    R
wait    3
snap
keys    Y
wait    1
send    \003
wait    2

shot    jotto
size    24 80
cap     Jotto: you and the computer each pick a secret five-letter word of all
cap     different letters, then take turns guessing.  Each guess is answered
cap     by how many of its letters occur in the hidden word -- `beach' has one
cap     in the computer's -- and the first to guess the other's word wins.
cap     Its word list is GAMES/JOTTO/jotto.d.
try     jotto
