shot    canfield
size    24 80
cap     Canfield, the casino solitaire you bet on: you pay to start and
cap     earn back for every card you get to a foundation.  Cards move in
cap     alternating colours on the tableau and by suit on the foundations;
cap     `ht' deals from the stock, and you name a move by its cards.
