size    24 80
cap     canfield is a casino game and this is the bank behind it: what the
cap     hands, the inspections, the games and the thinking time have cost,
cap     what came back, and what you are worth after the lot.  It reads the
cap     record canfield keeps for each user, so one hand is dealt and given
cap     up here first; before a first game it says so plainly instead.
