run     knight
wait    6
send    n
wait    3
send    s
wait    2
send    a
wait    1
send    1
wait    2
send    b
wait    1
send    3
wait    2
send    c
wait    1
send    1
wait    2
send    e
wait    1
send    2
wait    3
snap

shot    bks
size    24 80
cap     Bricks drop into the pit on the left and pile up at the bottom; the
