size    24 100
cap     A run down the slope, one row a turn: you are the I, and the ? at the
cap     end of each row waits for a letter -- here R, then L -- or Return.
cap     The Y's coming up are trees.
try     ski
run     clear
wait    1
run     ski
wait    4
send    \r
wait    1
send    \r
wait    1
send    R\r
wait    1
send    \r
wait    1
send    \r
wait    1
send    L\r
wait    1
send    \r
wait    1
send    \r
wait    2
