shot    wf
size    30 80
cap     A 12 by 12 square with its title and the list of the words it hid,
cap     made from `words', the file it reads from the current directory when
cap     no -f names one.  DOC/wf has that file and a second, words.2.
try     wf -x 12 -y 12 -t Words
run     builtin cd /dd/DOC/wf
wait    1
run     clear
wait    1
run     wf -x 12 -y 12 -t Words
wait    5

