shot    craps
size    24 80
cap     Ten dollars on the pass line and one roll of the dice: six and five,
cap     eleven, a winner on the come-out.  Each bet is a key, then the amount
cap     and Return -- `p' is the pass line; `r' rolls, `?' lists every key and
cap     `q' leaves.
try     craps
run     clear
wait    1
run     craps
wait    6
